        "id": 1121403
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-19T21:07:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "same as below, suggest merging these two blocks under the same write lock?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 462,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 466,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "882554beffff7c608ef2b77b348c807b66178080",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "192fcc2c_945bd2d7",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 466,
      "author": {
        "id": 1087037
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-19T22:16:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But I don\u0027t want to hold write lock when I call \"updateActiveDevices\", or when I wait for state machine to quit and cleanup.\n\nEspecially \"updateActiveDevices\" - as it makes blocking call to AudioFramework.\n\nIf I hold write lock, and make call to AF, and then AF calls BT stack back with operation that requires Read Lock, we get a deadlock.\n\nWrite lock should be held just for modifications of list they guard. All other read/access operation can be handled by read lock only.",
      "parentUuid": "e72c6e43_240df3f5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 462,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 466,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "882554beffff7c608ef2b77b348c807b66178080",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "23007138_1e0674e0",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 466,
      "author": {
        "id": 1929540
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-20T12:28:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with Jakub.\n\nwrite lock should protect only adding/removing elements from the list.",
      "parentUuid": "192fcc2c_945bd2d7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 462,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 466,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "882554beffff7c608ef2b77b348c807b66178080",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cc118e55_f9b9cdeb",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 3022,
      "author": {
        "id": 1121403
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-19T21:07:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "there is a time gap here. should we lock the write lock first before releasing the read lock?\n\nOR, just use the Write lock from the beginning, otherwise, you can\u0027t guarantee atomicity here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3018,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 3022,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "882554beffff7c608ef2b77b348c807b66178080",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "dbfda668_c1de5afa",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 3022,
      "author": {
        "id": 1087037
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-19T22:16:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When we hold read lock, there is no guarantee for atomicity, as multiple threads can lock it at same time.\n\nWe need atomicity just for removal of list element.\n\nFrom https://docs.oracle.com/javase/8/docs/api/java/util/concurrent/locks/ReentrantReadWriteLock.html : \n``writer can acquire the read lock, but not vice-versa``\n``If a reader tries to acquire the write lock it will never succeed.``",
      "parentUuid": "cc118e55_f9b9cdeb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3018,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 3022,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "882554beffff7c608ef2b77b348c807b66178080",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7618f52c_6defb99a",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
